(1. Global Disease Burden & Epidemiology \(Key Facts\)) Tj
ET
q 0.7 0.75 0.8 rg 45 627 522 0.75 re f Q
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 613 Td
(  * An estimated 1.4 billion adults aged 30-79 years worldwide live with hypertension.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 600 Td
(  * Two-thirds of people with hypertension live in low- and middle-income countries \(LMICs\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 587 Td
(  * Approximately 46% of adults with hypertension are completely unaware that they have the condition.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 574 Td
(  * Only 42% of adults with hypertension are diagnosed and treated, and only 21% have it controlled.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 561 Td
(  * Hypertension is a major independent cause of premature death globally, causing 10.8 million deaths annuall) Tj
ET
