/F2 11 Tf
0.1 0.25 0.55 rg
50 534 Td
(2. The 'Silent Killer' Clinical Concept & Pathophysiology) Tj
ET
q 0.7 0.75 0.8 rg 45 521 522 0.75 re f Q
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 507 Td
(  * Hypertension is medically termed 'The Silent Killer' because it typically produces zero symptoms for years) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 494 Td
(  * Insidious hydraulic shear stress progressively damages the vascular endothelial lining across vital organs) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 481 Td
(  * Absence of symptoms does not indicate absence of disease; relying on feelings or mild headaches is medical) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.1 0.1 0.15 rg
55 468 Td
(  * Routine annual blood pressure screening is universally mandatory for all adults >=18 years.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.1 0.25 0.55 rg
50 441 Td
