ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 217 Td
(  2. Acute crushing chest pain, tightness, or pressure \(angina pectoris / acute coronary syndrome\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 204 Td
(  3. Acute severe dyspnea, shortness of breath, or orthopnea \(pulmonary edema\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 191 Td
(  4. Sudden focal neurological deficit: Facial droop, hemiparesis, dysarthria, or numbness.) Tj
